Earlier, I watched a video talking about how men are starved for physical touch, which kind of surprised me. I always just kind of assumed that guys didn't like that sort of thing. And then I read the comments and they were so sad! They said things like "the first flowers a man gets are at his funeral" and how some of these guys went years and years without getting hugs, handshakes, or compliments! D;

So, um... This is a bit awkward to ask, but, uh... Do any of you guys want a hug? Like, obviously I can't come over to your house and give you a hug in person right now, but I'd be up for virtual hugs. :3 Maybe? Maybe I'm being too girly about this kind of thing, but...um...leave a comment if you want a virtual hug or a compliment and I'll try my best. <3

And here's [url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9FoTgirSjkc]a fun little song[/url] that all the cool kids are listening to (maybe). ːsteamsunnyː Say, what did you guys think of the Mario Movie? Pretty fun, right? :D Lastly, here are some [url=https://twitter.com/CherryCoStudios/status/1655397593965547520]less important cupcake pictures[/url] to end off this post! ːsteamdanceː
